{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22935","headline":"浔阳春三首 春来 · 白居易","name":"浔阳春三首 春来","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春来触地故乡情，忽见风光忆两京。\n金谷蹋花香骑入，曲江碾草钿车行。\n谁家绿酒欢连夜，何处红楼睡失明。\n独有不眠不醉客，经春冷坐古湓城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22935.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22935","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}